  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;be the pole of height&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;be the pole of height&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Also, let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>&#8869;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi></math>&nbsp;is a rectangle and hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;and the distance between the poles is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo></math>let<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>)</mo><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ffaa3f19-64e0-4211-ac40-74350f7f5db4-image10.png\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 175px;\" /><br />In <math><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>15</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mi>K</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>15</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
